?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>YonoLootZone CMS</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;background:#f8fafc;margin:0;color:#0f172a}.top{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.wrap{max-width:1150px;margin:25px auto;padding:0 16px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #00000008}input,textarea,select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:10px;margin:5px 0 12px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px}textarea{min-height:150px}button,.btn{background:#e00068;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 16px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}.notice{padding:12px;background:#ecfdf5;color:#166534;border-radius:8px}.error{padding:12px;background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b;border-radius:8px}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><div class="top"><strong>YonoLootZone CMS</strong><a href="?logout=1">Logout</a></div><main class="wrap"><h1>Server-side Publishing</h1><p>Create content here and the CMS writes the HTML page, updates the sitemap and refreshes the posts index.</p><?php if($notice):?><p class="notice"><?=h($notice)?></p><?php endif;?><?php if($error):?><p class="error"><?=h($error)?></p><?php endif;?><div class="grid"><section class="card"><h2>Publish Post</h2><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="post"><label>Title</label><input name="title" required><label>Slug</label><input name="slug" placeholder="auto-from-title"><label>Date</label><input type="date" name="date" value="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>"><label>Type</label><select name="type"><option>Article Update</option><option>New Game</option><option>How-to Guide</option><option>Comparison / List</option></select><label>Author</label><input name="author" value="YonoLootZone"><label>Meta Description</label><input name="description" maxlength="160" required><label>Excerpt</label><input name="excerpt"><label>Featured Image URL</label><input name="image" placeholder="/assets/example.webp"><label>Image ALT</label><input name="imageAlt"><label>Video URL (optional)</label><input name="video" placeholder="YouTube URL or direct .mp4"><label>Article HTML</label><textarea name="content" placeholder="<p>...</p><h2>...</h2>"></textarea><button>Publish Post</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Publish New Game</h2><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="game"><label>Game Name</label><input name="name" required><label>Slug</label><input name="slug"><label>Category</label><input name="category" value="Yono Game"><label>Game Image URL</label><input name="image" placeholder="assets/game.webp"><label>Game / Download URL</label><input name="url"><label>SEO Title</label><input name="seoTitle"><label>Meta Description</label><input name="metaDescription" maxlength="160" required><label>Description</label><textarea name="description"></textarea><button>Publish Game</button></form></section></div><div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px"><section class="card"><h2>Published Posts (<?=count($posts)?>)</h2><?php foreach(array_reverse($posts) as $p):?><p><a href="/posts/<?=h($p['slug'])?>/"><?=h($p['title'])?></a></p><?php endforeach;?></section><section class="card"><h2>Games in data (<?=count($games)?>)</h2><p>The CMS writes new games into <code>data/games.json</code> and creates their public SEO page.</p></section></div></main></body></html>
